      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "\r\n\r\n\r\nKnitting the Seamless Color Block Blanket isn’t just about making a cozy throw—it’s about creating something beautiful that’s uniquely yours. With its customizable design, you can choose colors that reflect your personality or match your space perfectly. Whether you want a bold, modern look or a soft, classic feel, <span class=\"yellow_highlight\">this blanket is your canvas.</span><br>This project is perfect if you want to create something amazing without the hassle of seaming or worrying about running out of needles. The no-sew technique makes the process fast and enjoyable, so you can focus on the fun of seeing your blanket come together. Just imagine the pride you’ll feel wrapping up in a beautiful, finished blanket that you made! This is your chance to create something special while growing your skills—and <span class=\"yellow_highlight\">enjoy every step along the way.</span>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/131/color-block-blanket-machine-knitting.gif\">\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 10047,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "You can Knit this",
          "slug": "you-can-knit-this",
          "order": 1,
