              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<h3>Hi {first}</h3>\r\n        Ensure success with your blanket by <b>learning and practicing</b> the Sew-as-You-Go method <b>BEFORE</b> starting your blanket.<br>\r\n        Knit swatches as instructed in the Skill Builder or use the edges of your swatch to practice. <br><div class=\"text-center\"><br><a href=\"/skillbuilder/4331/sew-as-you-go\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n            <img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/131/sew-as-you-go-skill-builder-machine-knitting.jpg\">\r\n        </a></div>",
