      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<style>\r\n    .handwriting {'Handlee', cursive;\r\n        color: #9E2065;\r\n        font-weight: 600;\r\n    }\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n        <span><i class=\"fa-solid fa-caret-down fa-2xl\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3 style=\"display: inline-block; margin-left: 10px;\"> Are you new to Knit it Now Patterns?</h3>\r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \r\n            \r\n                The Seamless Color Block Blanket is made up of squares, giving you full control over the finished size. You'll start by deciding whether to knit 3 or 5 blocks across. The total number of blocks in the blanket is then calculated based on the size you choose from the sizing chart.<br><ol>\r\n                    <li>Choose a blanket size</li>\r\n                    <li>Choose 3 or 5 panels</li>\r\n                    <li>Optional: Click the button \"Customize your Pattern\"</li>\r\n                    <li>Double Check your measurements</li>\r\n                    <li>Enter YOUR gauge</li>\r\n                    <li>Click the button to \"Create Your custom pattern\"</li>\r\n                </ol>\r\n                <br>\r\n                <b>NOTE:</b> Before you begin knitting:\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Double-check the calculated finished size to ensure it's exactly what you want. If it's not quite right, no problem! You can easily modify the blanket size and re-run the pattern to adjust.</li>\r\n                    <li>Don't forget to review the updated yarn requirements based on your adjustments to ensure you have enough to complete your project.</li>\r\n                </ul>\r\n                Taking these steps upfront ensures a stress-free knitting experience and a blanket you'll love!<br><a class=\"videopopup\" data-videotitle=\"KIN_Pattern_overview\" data-vimeoid=\"772256112\"><i class=\"fa fa-youtube-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Are you new to Knit it Now Patterns?\"</a>\r\n            \r\n            \r\n                <img class=\"img-thumbnail img1\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/131/build_pattern.jpg\">\r\n            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n    function togglePanel(header) {\r\n        var content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        var arrow = header.querySelector('.fa-caret-down');\r\n        \r\n        if (content.style.display === 'none') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            arrow.style.transform = 'rotate(180deg)';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            arrow.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n</script>",
